      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This is a comment on a meta-analysis of published studies comparing cold vs hot polypectomy. We believe that the conclusion of this meta-analysis that \"cold polypectomy is a time-saving procedure for removing small polyps with markedly similar curability and safety to hot polypectomy\" needs more rigorous evidence."},
